#{{AIHEADER}}:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="tests/**, **Tests/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- dotnet test
- dotnet test --collect:"XPlat Code Coverage" for coverage

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- xUnit: Facts for single cases, Theories for parameterized
- Test class: FooTests, methods: MethodName_Scenario_ExpectedResult
- Moq or NSubstitute for mocking interfaces
- FluentAssertions for readable assertions (optional but common)
- WebApplicationFactory<Program> for integration tests

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "Coverlet with 80% threshold enforced in CI")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real database in unit tests — use in-memory EF or SQLite
- No real HTTP calls — use HttpClient with fake handler
- No [Ignore] / Skip without a comment and tracking issue
